{"title":"Toronto Yorkville Singles Masquerade Party (Age 25-45) ","startsAt":"2026-10-29T20:00:00-04:00","endsAt":"2026-10-29T23:00:00-04:00","status":"ACTIVE","type":"PHYSICAL","description":"**NOTE:** This is a ticketed event.\n\n**Tickets here:** https://www.eventbrite.com/e/toronto-yorkville-singles-masquerade-party-age-25-45-free-for-ladies-tickets-2001231099089?aff=oddtdtcreator&keep_tld=true\n\nDress up, grab a mask, and mingle! Join Toronto’s chicest singles for cocktails, connections & possible romance! Drink included.\nGet ready for a night of **mystery, cocktails, and new connections** at our Toronto Yorkville Singles Masquerade Party!\n\nWe're pulling out all the stops and **aiming to make this our biggest singles night ever**. Join hundreds of Toronto singles for an unforgettable evening at the elegant **The Powder Room**, a stylish cocktail lounge in the heart of Yorkville.\n\n✨ **Come dressed to impress**\n🎭 **Masquerade theme** — bring your favourite mask, or we'll provide one at no charge if you don't have one\n🍸 **One drink included with your ticket** — Martini, mixed drink, or pop. Arrive by 9pm.\n\nSee someone you like? Give them a Like or a Pass on your phone using our exclusive web app, and if the feeling is mutual we will notify you the next day. Make sure to sign up for a profile on www.15firstdates if you'd like to participate.\n\n**The bigger the crowd, the more people there are to meet. Help us make this our biggest singles night yet!**","venue":{"name":"Powder Room","address":"129 Yorkville Ave, Toronto, ON M5R 1B9, Canada, Toronto","lat":43.670599,"lng":-79.393433,"city":"Toronto"},"fee":null,"group":"Social Toronto!!!","image":"https://secure.meetupstatic.com/photos/event/2/c/4/f/highres_536171343.jpeg"}